  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Environmental Peacemaking in Somalia II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective is to improve relationships and dialogue between the Federal Government of Somalia and four Federal Member States over environmental governance, as well as support international partners with strategic research on environmental peace-making topics to enhance environmental governance, to contribute to conflict resolution and prevention in Somalia. The project focuses on three target groups, first Somali FGS and FMS actors with environmental mandates. Second, Somali FGS and FMS actors working on interior, justice and security. And third, international actors working on environment, climate peace and security in Somalia.</narrative>
  </description>
